ose button is not displayed and the alert message"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"remains visible until the context changes (e.g., the issue is resolved, the screen is refreshed). Otherwise, the alert message is dismissable and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"includes a close button, allowing the user to dismiss it when he has acknowledged the message.  Some alerts must remain visible to ensure"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"user is aware of important information; others can be closed to reduce visual clutter."}]}]}]},{"content":[{"anchor":"discussion","text":"Discussion","level":2,"type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Use the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"View\/disabled(_:)"},{"type":"text","text":" method to have component in disabled state."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["    OUDSAlertMessage(label: \"Success! Your form was submitted.\",","                     status: .positive,","                     description: AttributedString(markdown: \"This is **an important notice**\")) \/\/ Manage in your side errors for init"],"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing"}],"kind":"content"}],"sections":[],"kind":"symbol","identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSAlertMessage\/init(label:status:description:bulletList:link:onClose:)-8e668"},"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/oudscomponents\/oudsalertmessage\/init(label:status:description:bulletlist:link:onclose:)-8e668"]}],"references":{"doc://OUDSComponents/documentation/OUDSComponents/OUDSAlertMessage":{"fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"OUDSAlertMessage","kind":"identifier"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"OUDSAlertMessage","kind":"identifier"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Alert message is a UI element that displays system feedback, status changes or required action; throughout deta